; The STYLE table rewritten from the model is identical at group level ([0.8-RT11], work #683;
; ADR 0018, point 6): the same stili.dxf as stili-testo/tabella-giro (handwritten, R2018),
; with the shape file record raw between Altezza5 and Larghezza08 (mixed order kept),
; the XDATA ACAD of Altezza5, the bigfont of Larghezza08, 71=6 of Capovolto and
; $TEXTSTYLE = Larghezza08. No entities.
D = DXF file=stili.dxf
? version D -> AC1032
? units D -> 4
? count D -> none
? unhandled D -> none
? roundtrip D -> identical
? roundtrip D as=cadx -> identical
